  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi Donor Trust Fund - Social Protection Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">World Bank-managed Multi-Donor Trust Fund (MDTF), supporting Mozambican Government on key reforms under the Social Protection and Economic Resilience Project &#x2014; including improvements in targeting, payment systems, human capital outcomes, and women&#x2019;s economic empowerment. Through this MDTF, the UK directly supported a grant package that strengthened Mozambique&#x2019;s three largest social protection programmes and accelerated the development of adaptive social protection approaches capable of rapidly responding to climate, health and economic shocks.</narrative>
  </description>
